# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:582
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_cedf9ed1:

    # "As I sat down at one of the tables, Shay returned after a short while with my food and drink."
    "Enquanto eu me sentava em uma das mesas, Shay voltou depois de pouco tempo com minha comida e bebida."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:583
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_b9c578ac:

    # "The piping hot deer smelt amazing; it had been a long time since I had enjoyed a meal quite so expensive."
    "O veado quente encanamento cheirava incrível; já fazia muito tempo que eu tinha gostado de uma refeição muito cara."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:584
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_49313434:

    # "A meal such as this now, was a reserved treat father would have bought us to celebrate Harvest Day once a year."
    "Uma refeição como esta agora, era um pai de presente reservado teria nos comprado para celebrar o Dia da Colheita uma vez por ano."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:585
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_8551840f:

    # "Many would not even think of wasting the coin on such a thing, and it was simply unattainable for most."
    "Muitos nem sequer pensariam em desperdiçar a moeda em tal coisa, e era simplesmente inacessível para a maioria."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:586
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_260eee86:

    # "Here I was though, not only able to afford it, but enjoying it almost as though it was like any other meal."
    "Aqui estava eu, porém, não só capaz de pagá - lo, mas apreciando - o quase como se fosse como qualquer outra refeição."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:587
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_c7ae9e21:

    # "Despite the inherent danger... The mercenary life paid well alright."
    "Apesar do perigo inerente... A vida de mercenário pagava bem."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:588
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_4017ecb0:

    # "Beneath the table, I rested the container holding Myu, and would every so often palm a piece of the meat under the table which she would take from my hand gently with a tentacle to consume."
    "Debaixo da mesa, eu descansei o recipiente segurando Myu, e de vez em quando palma um pedaço da carne debaixo da mesa que ela tomaria da minha mão suavemente com um tentáculo para consumir."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:589
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_aa209940:

    # "Finally, once the meal was finished, I gathered Myu back into my possession once again and rose to my feet."
    "Finalmente, quando a refeição acabou, recolhi a Myu de volta à minha posse e levantei-me."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:593
translate ptPT qst_HumanExp_8_shayGetBetterFood_69ba816e:

